  "core_principles": [
    "Concept Layer and Patent Instance Layer are separated.",
    "Patent Facts require patent-specific evidence; domain knowledge does not automatically create facts.",
    "First/Second are instances, not separate master concepts.",
    "State is stored as StateAssertion, not duplicated as a Claim Element attribute.",
    "Entity mobility and Relation motion must not duplicate the same fact.",
    "Technology is multi-label; display_primary is a report-only representative label.",
    "Problem and Effect links require patent-specific evidence and are not inferred 1:1.",
    "E4/PE4/EE4 domain inference must not be output as Patent Fact."
  ]
